{
  "id": "hold-aware-rise",
  "display_name": "Hold-Aware Rise",
  "description": "A firm per-word rise that declares how long the copy must stay up to be read before anything exits.",
  "inspiration": "Subtitles and lower thirds: animating in is easy; leaving it up long enough is the job.",
