  "usage_notes": "Hold = enter.x_hold_ms + words × enter.x_hold_per_word_ms, counted from the moment the last word settles. Never start the exit sooner to fit a loop: lengthen the loop. 250ms/word suits short display copy; 300+ for body-like lines.",
  "x_intent": "editorial",
  "x_intent_notes": "Same physics as spring-rise-letters, per word, plus a reading contract.",
